## 3. AI Onboarding — Keep Docs in Sync

Every meaningful change must keep AI-readable docs updated so any model can onboard quickly.

**Required files (maintain on every change):**
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `AGENTS.md` | Entry point — project summary, stack, conventions, file map |
| `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` | Structure, data flow, key decisions |
| `docs/CHANGELOG.md` | Brief log of significant changes (newest first) |

**On each change:**
1. Update affected doc sections — do not leave docs stale
2. Add new files/folders to the file map in `AGENTS.md`
3. Record non-obvious decisions in `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
4. Append a one-line entry to `docs/CHANGELOG.md`

**Writing style for AI docs:** Short headings, bullet lists, concrete paths, no fluff.
